The embassy extended its sincere thanks to the Ministries of Youth and Sports of both countries, Cricket Association of Nepal and the BCB for their pivotal role in advancing this partnership.

Both sides are committed to deepening ties through men's and women's tours, high performance programmes, and training and technical support, said the Nepalese Embassy in Dhaka.

